{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for DealAlert Nearby', 'description': 'Primary container for DealAlert Nearby implementation: A mobile app that alerts users to flash sales and discounts at nearby stores, restaurants, or cafes based on their location. Deals are sourced from public APIs and user submissions, with real-time updates, deal timers, and push notifications. Monetization is via ads and affiliate links. The app uses React Native for cross-platform UI, Firebase for backend and authentication, and geolocation for proximity-based deals.', 'framework': 'express', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft backend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Location-based Deal Alerts",\n      "description": "Notifies users of flash sales and discounts at nearby businesses using geolocation.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Deal Timer",\n      "description": "Displays a countdown timer for each deal to create urgency and show offer validity.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Real-time Deal Updates",\n      "description": "Uses Firebase Firestore to store and update deals in real time.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "User Authentication",\n      "description": "Allows users to sign up and log in using Firebase Authentication.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Push Notifications",\n      "description": "Sends push notifications for new or expiring deals using Firebase Cloud Messaging.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "User Deal Submission",\n      "description": "Enables users to submit local deals for community sharing.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Ad & Affiliate Monetization",\n      "description": "Displays ads via Google AdMob and includes affiliate links for monetization.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "Express.js"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#000000",\n    "secondary": "#FFFFFF",\n    "accent": "#4CAF50"\n  },\n  "theme": "dark",\n  "layoutDescription": "The app features a simple, card-based UI showing nearby deals with images, business names, discount details, and a visible countdown timer. A map or list view toggles between visualizing deals. The bottom navigation includes Home (deals), Submit (add a deal), and Profile (user settings). Push notifications and banners for urgent deals appear at the top. Clean, intuitive design with prominent call-to-action buttons."\n}'}",
